OL,5,G0045 Shop on TV
OL,6,G0300 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,7,     FDermot O'Leary travels to
OL,8,     FLetterkenny in Co Donegal,
OL,9,     Fdiscovering a place full of
OL,10,     Funforgettable people, stories and
OL,11,     Ffood. He forages for golden
OL,12,     Fmushrooms in an ancient rainforest
OL,13,     Fbefore learning to make tortellini
OL,14,     Fcompletely from scratch. Dermot
OL,15,     Falso meets a Syrian
OL,16,     Frefugee-turned-honey farmer who
OL,17,     Fteaches him how to extract honey
OL,18,     Ffrom the hive and shares
OL,19,     Ftraditions from home, including
OL,20,     Fhow to enjoy honey with strong
OL,21,     Fcoffee and a sweet dish called
OL,22,     Fknaffe
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
