OL,5,G0505 The Joy of Pets
OL,6,     FGaby Roslin and vet Bolu Eso meet
OL,7,     Fa family who share their home with
OL,8,     F37 animals, while they get up
OL,9,     Fclose with tarantulas and reveal
OL,10,     Fhow to help protect wildlife from
OL,11,     Fpets. Plus, they see how therapy
OL,12,     Fdog Chester brings comfort and joy
OL,13,     Fto care home residents, meet
OL,14,     Fguinea pigs and discover more
OL,15,     Fabout the fascinating behaviour of
OL,16,     Fthe animals people love
